## Imagery (`public/imagery/`)

Every file under `public/imagery/` is a derived crop or resampling of third-party
photography. `scripts/fetch-imagery.mjs` records each source URL, bounding box,
projection, resampling, and a SHA-256 of what was downloaded.

- **NASA Blue Marble Next Generation** (topography and bathymetry, August 2004,
